<!-- ===== 3. SECTOR GROUPINGS ===== -->
<section class="section" id="sectors">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.8rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="Sektor">Sectors</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Empat sektor, empat cara bekerja.">Four sectors, four ways of working.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Setiap sektor menuntut irama yang berbeza &mdash; kelulusan yang lebih ketat, kitaran yang lebih pantas, atau layanan produk yang lebih terperinci. Beginilah rupanya.">Each sector asks for a different rhythm &mdash; tighter approvals, a faster cycle, or a more detailed product treatment. Here is what that looks like.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="step-list step-list--2">
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Korporat &amp; insurans">Corporate &amp; insurance</h3>
        <p data-bm="Kandungan yang mesti lulus semakan pematuhan dan tetap dilihat orang. Podcast langsung bulanan, media sosial sentiasa aktif, acara agensi berskala besar, dan filem kesedaran korporat &mdash; dijalankan sebagai satu sistem kreatif dan bukan projek berasingan.">Content that has to clear compliance review and still get watched. A monthly live podcast, always-on social, large-scale agency events and corporate awareness films &mdash; run as one creative system rather than separate projects.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip">Prudential BSN Takaful</span>
          <span class="chip">PruBSN Stars</span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Media &amp; kreator">Media &amp; creators</h3>
        <p data-bm="Format yang berulang setiap minggu atau setiap bulan. Set podcast yang boleh diulang, produksi multi-kamera, potongan sosial pada hari yang sama, dan kandungan digital merentasi Instagram, Facebook, TikTok dan YouTube.">Formats that repeat every week or every month. Repeatable podcast sets, multi-camera production, same-day social cutdowns and digital content across Instagram, Facebook, TikTok and YouTube.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip">Jom Borak</span>
          <span class="chip">Kata Kita</span>
          <span class="chip">SpaceDollah</span>
          <span class="chip">Flow State</span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Gaya hidup &amp; F&amp;B">Lifestyle &amp; F&amp;B</h3>
        <p data-bm="Kerja yang dinilai pada bingkai tunggal. Penggambaran produk dan komersial untuk penjagaan kulit premium, dan kandungan jenama fine-dining di mana makanan, ruang dan cahaya perlu terasa semahal rasanya.">Work that is judged on a single frame. Product and commercial shoots for premium skincare, and fine-dining brand content where the food, the room and the light have to feel as expensive as they taste.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip">Anaaka</span>
          <span class="chip">Au Jardin</span>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Runcit &amp; mobiliti">Retail &amp; mobility</h3>
        <p data-bm="Kandungan yang terikat kepada pelancaran dan rak. Filem produk dan pelancaran untuk jenama kopi khusus, ditambah keupayaan pengedaran runcit kami &mdash; pelepasan kastam, logistik gudang-ke-kedai, inventori dan analitik jualan.">Content tied to a launch and a shelf. Product and launch films for specialty coffee brands, plus our retail distribution capability &mdash; customs clearance, warehouse-to-store logistics, inventory and sales analytics.</p>
        <div class="chip-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem">
          <span class="chip">Carsome</span>
          <span class="chip" data-bm="Kopi Khusus">Specialty Coffee</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="pkg__note reveal" data-bm="Jenama lain dalam senarai kami termasuk Jentayu, Larenme, Renewal, Ayubee dan Estika. Kredit penuh tersedia atas permintaan.">Other brands on our list include Jentayu, Larenme, Renewal, Ayubee and Estika. Full credits are available on request.</p>
  </div>
</section>

